       method-id.  To_Screen protected.                                                                                                                                                                 
       procedure division.                                                                                                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      * If not Post Back ...                                                                                                                                                                            
      *   If screen was redirected from another screen get the session                                                                                                                                  
      *   number from the screen query pair for "SESSION".                                                                                                                                              
      *    IF NOT Self::IsPostBack                                                                                                                                                                      
      *       MOVE SPACES TO REDIRECT-SCREEN-SESSION                                                                                                                                                    
      *       SET REDIRECT-SCREEN-SESSION TO Self::Request::QueryString::Item("SESSION")                                                                                                                
      *       IF REDIRECT-SCREEN-SESSION NOT = SPACES                                                                                                                                                   
      *          MOVE REDIRECT-SCREEN-SESSION TO THIS-SESSION-ALPHA.                                                                                                                                    
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * If not Post Back ...                                                                                                                                                                            
      *   IF THIS IS A NEW SCREEN THEN READ THE PASSING FILE                                                                                                                                            
      *    IF NOT Self::IsPostBack                                                                                                                                                                      
      *       IF PCIM-FILE-SCREEN NOT = THIS-SCREEN-NAME                                                                                                                                                
      *           MOVE "R"          TO PASS-ACTION-CODE                                                                                                                                                 
      *           MOVE THIS-SESSION TO PASS-SESSION-NUMBER                                                                                                                                              
      *           MOVE SPACES       TO PASS-SESSION-DATA                                                                                                                                                
      *           MOVE ZERO         TO PASS-STATUS-CODE                                                                                                                                                 
      *           SET PASSINGFILECLASS TO NEW IdealRoutines.PASSINGFILE                                                                                                                                 
      *           INVOKE PASSINGFILECLASS::PASSINGFILEMETHOD(PASS-PARAMETERS)                                                                                                                           
      *           SET PASSINGFILECLASS   TO NULL                                                                                                                                                        
      *           MOVE PASS-SESSION-DATA TO PCIM-FILE-AREA                                                                                                                                              
      *           MOVE PCIM-FILE-DATA       TO D158302-REC                                                                                                                                              
      *           MOVE PCIM-FILE-CURSOR     TO D158302-CURSOR                                                                                                                                           
      *           MOVE PCIM-FILE-ATTRIBUTES TO D158302-ATTR                                                                                                                                             
      *           MOVE PCIM-FILE-TEMP       TO D158302-TEMP                                                                                                                                             
      *           MOVE PCIM-FILE-ERROR      TO D158302-ERROR                                                                                                                                            
      *           MOVE PCIM-FILE-RECEIVED   TO D158302-RECEIVED                                                                                                                                         
      *           INVOKE Self::"Pcim_Data_To_Output".                                                                                                                                                   
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * WRITE THE PASSING PARAMETERS TO THE PASSING FILE.                                                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
           MOVE "W"            TO PASS-ACTION-CODE                                                                                                                                                      
           MOVE THIS-SESSION   TO PASS-SESSION-NUMBER                                                                                                                                                   
           MOVE PCIM-FILE-AREA TO PASS-SESSION-DATA                                                                                                                                                     
           MOVE ZERO           TO PASS-STATUS-CODE                                                                                                                                                      
           SET PASSINGFILECLASS TO NEW IdealRoutines.PASSINGFILE                                                                                                                                        
           INVOKE PASSINGFILECLASS::PASSINGFILEMETHOD(PASS-PARAMETERS)                                                                                                                                  
           SET PASSINGFILECLASS TO NULL.                                                                                                                                                                
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      * PCIM-FILE-SCREEN contains the name of the screen to be displayed                                                                                                                                
      * If this is not this screen then redirect to the new screen.                                                                                                                                     
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
           IF PCIM-FILE-SCREEN NOT = SPACES AND THIS-SCREEN-NAME                                                                                                                                        
              MOVE SPACES        TO SCREEN-NAME                                                                                                                                                         
              STRING PCIM-FILE-SCREEN   DELIMITED BY SPACE                                                                                                                                              
                    ".aspx"             DELIMITED BY SIZE                                                                                                                                               
                    "?SESSION="         DELIMITED BY SIZE                                                                                                                                               
                    THIS-SESSION-ALPHA  DELIMITED BY SIZE                                                                                                                                               
                    INTO SCREEN-NAME                                                                                                                                                                    
              SET NEXT-SCREEN   TO SCREEN-NAME::Trim                                                                                                                                                    
              INVOKE Self::Response::Redirect(NEXT-SCREEN).                                                                                                                                             
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * DATA IS FOR THIS SCREEN                                                                                                                                                                         
      * SO SAVE A COPY OF THE SCREEN DATA FROM THE PROGRAM                                                                                                                                              
      * LOAD THE SCREEN FIELDS                                                                                                                                                                          
      * AND SEND THE SCREEN TO THE TERMINAL                                                                                                                                                             
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
           INVOKE Self::"Set_Screen_Cursor".                                                                                                                                                            
           INVOKE Self::"Load_Screen".                                                                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * SET THE FIELD ATTRIBUTES IF ANY HAVE BEEN MODOIFIED                                                                                                                                             
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
           INVOKE Self::"Modify_Attributes".                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
       end method To_Screen.                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
